From 03294fa15f44f6045d60c72db56875bb2cb46883 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 19:20:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Rebuild AttentionOS mobile app: seven agents, Supabase queue,
 minimal UI

- Add lib/ (Supabase REST client, verified Gemini model resolver, deterministic
  guardrails, seven agents, job queue) and api/aos.js + api/cron.js
- Pipeline: Analyst -> Strategist -> Copywriter (safety gate) -> Art Director
  -> owner approval -> Publisher (idempotent, provider-sourced status)
- Replace index.html with a six-area dark workspace (app.js, app.css); JARVIS
  now starts real agent workflows and can never approve or publish
- Reuse existing Reel Studio renderer for the real MP4; credits re-checked
- Add aos-pipeline and aos-ui tests; retire three tests of the removed overlay
- Daily Vercel cron for queue drain and analytics learning

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MfQqGyzaMND3rHh2s3sCjd
